Bundled lexical data
--------------------
The file

    inflector-core/src/main/resources/io/github/morphex/inflector/lexicon-v1.tsv

is generated from the English noun extract published by Kaikki.org, itself derived from
English Wiktionary by Wiktextract. That data is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Attribution: Wiktionary contributors, via Kaikki.org (Tatu Ylonen) and Wiktextract.
See data/LICENSE-DATA.md for the exact snapshot, checksum and obligations.

The code and the data are separately licensed. The data file is distributed next to the
code in the jar; it is not relicensed by the MIT license. Consumers who cannot accept
CC BY-SA 3.0 for the data can build without it: the engine runs with the three productive
rules only (see README, "Rules-only build").

Reference implementations and prior art
---------------------------------------
This project was specified against atteo/evo-inflector. No evo-inflector code or data is
bundled. Stock evo-inflector 2.0 is used only as a benchmark/evaluation dependency in
non-published modules (inflector-benchmarks, inflector-eval), under its own license.

JUnit 5 (test scope) and JMH (benchmark module only) are used under their respective
licenses and are not runtime dependencies of the published artifact.
